conx-eq:LiftingEquipment a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-site/equipment-type> ; skos:prefLabel "Lifting Equipment"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Hebezeug"@de .
conx-eq:Crane a skos:Concept ; skos:broader conx-eq:LiftingEquipment ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-site/equipment-type> ; skos:prefLabel "Crane"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Kran"@de .
