conx-eq:IndustrialTruck a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-site/equipment-type> ; skos:prefLabel "Industrial Truck"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Flurförderer"@de .
conx-eq:Forklift a skos:Concept ; skos:broader conx-eq:IndustrialTruck ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-site/equipment-type> ; skos:prefLabel "Forklift"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Gabelstapler"@de .
